{
  "_comment": "The retry decision. A search with max_retries (default 1) gets this response first and a 200 search body after it. retried: whether the second attempt was made. wait: the seconds slept before it, or \"backoff\" for the first backoff step (0.375 to 0.5 s with jitter), or null when nothing was retried. kind: the error class when the call failed. `json` is sent as its JSON text; `body` is sent as is.",
